#N A multiplexed wire (Carlini, Part 5)
#O Nicholas Carlini, 2022
#C One wire carrying four bits at once, one in each of four slots of 60 generations. Here it carries 3: two ships every 240 generations, side by side.
#C Part 5: Multiplexing Circuits on the Game of Life - Part 5 (2022-02-27)
#C https://nicholas.carlini.com/writing/2022/multiplexing-circuits-game-of-life.html
#C Section: Multiplexing Wires
